\section{Dominance and guarantee}{

Alternative \code{j} \emph{epsilon-dominates} \code{k} when, for every objective \code{i},
\code{mu[j, i] <= mu[k, i] + epsilon[i]}: \code{j} is at least as good as \code{k} up to the
